::Asil [c5 trainer]
The source of the hushing sound comes into view. You see a short, older lady with what could only be described as a witch's hat. She is looking left and right and shushing into the forest. A [add mergimal description] is sitting on a giant mushroom by the witch\'s side, looking pained.

[[Ask what she is shooshing.-> Asil: shush]]
[[Leave her alone.-> 221]]

:: Asil: shoosh [c5 trainer contest]
"I need to keep the forest quiet. My Mergimal is very sensitive to sound and everything is being way too loud!" Her voice is louder than anything else in the forest.

"Can you help me? If you could find the source of all this racket, my Mergimal would be so grateful. No matter what I do, they are still so dsitressed!" The Mergimal winces and tries to cover their ears, but their arms are too short.

[[Try to think of a solution.->Asil: worksheet]]
[[Leave her alone.-> 221]]

:: Asil: worksheet [c5 trainer contest]
Something seems off about this whole thing. You think you can help, but need to gather your thoughts.

Do worksheet 'The Loud Witch'.
 --- this should be a stand alone worksheet (problem)  - wait on shushing solution

Enter the code:  <<numberbox '_$code' 0>>
<<link 'See if you have the solution. - code is 1 for now'>>
    <<if _$code != 1>>
        <<dialog 'incorrect'>>\
            <<include 'incorrect'>>
        <</dialog>>
    <<else>>
        <<dialog 'correct'>>\
            <<include 'correct'>>
            <<onclose>>
                <<goto 'Asil: answer'>>
        <</dialog>>
    <</if>>
<</link>>
[[Leave her alone for now and continue exploring.->221]]